camelCase:
The very first letter is lowercase.
Every next word starts with an uppercase letter.
Example: myVariableName or firstName. 

PascalCase:
The very first letter is uppercase.
Every next word also starts with an uppercase letter.
Example: MyVariableName or FirstName

Sanke Case
Snake case is a naming style where spaces are replaced with underscores (_) and all letters are written in lowercase. 
Key examples include first_name, total_count, and user_profile
